      "description": "<p data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3819\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3819\">The Frames – For the Birds – 2LP Vinyl – Overcoat Recordings OC 11LP</strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3933\">Scarce double-vinyl edition of <em data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"3867\">For the Birds</em> by Irish indie rock band <strong data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3907\">The Frames</strong>, led by <strong data-start=\"3916\" data-end=\"3932\">Glen Hansard</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"4209\">Originally released in 2001, <em data-start=\"3964\" data-end=\"3979\">For the Birds</em> became one of the band's defining albums, blending atmospheric indie rock, folk and emotionally driven songwriting. This vinyl edition was issued by Overcoat Recordings as a <strong data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4170\">2×12\" LP set</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"4107\" data-content-reference-end=\"4149\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"4211\" data-end=\"4365\">Recording credits include <strong data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4253\">Steve Albini</strong>, Craig Ward and David Odlum, with sessions taking place in part at Albini's Electrical Audio studio in Chicago.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4367\" data-end=\"4381\"><strong data-start=\"4367\" data-end=\"4381\">Track List</strong></p>\n<ol data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4618\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1odjqob\" data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4404\">\nIn the Deep Shade\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10z6n2v\" data-start=\"4405\" data-end=\"4421\">\nLay Me Down\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1lu8nkn\" data-start=\"4422\" data-end=\"4465\">\nWhat Happens When the Heart Just Stops\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0u3fh\" data-start=\"4466\" data-end=\"4479\">\nHeadlong\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"z1u4ik\" data-start=\"4480\" dat